    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_3ff2d3e3",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_file_name; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a swimmer underwater, with text overlaid that reads, 'the only thing that hinders you is your own motivation.' The scene is motivational in tone, using the visual of swimming as a metaphor for overcoming obstacles through self-driven effort. There is no visible toxicity, harmful content, or disparaging stereotypes present in the image. The meme's intent is to inspire and encourage self-motivation, using the swimmer's action as a visual representation of progress and perseverance. The overall intent is motivational and inspirational, not abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_8a8c8c82"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
